				<u>Eq.</u>
				536
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				152b
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνθιασώτης τοῦ ληρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					508
				</span></i>
			; 
