			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				497b
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ληρήσῃς τὸν ἐκτιναγμόν σου</span>”
